{"seq":2,"slug":"royalty-risk-control-metrics","title":"权利金风险控制与度量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/compliance-audit-risk/royalty-risk-control-metrics","wordCount":2531,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"权利金风险控制与度量指标\">权利金风险控制与度量指标</h1><p>一家跨境电商企业每月向境外关联方支付商标与技术许可费，账上有付款凭证、合同和分摊表。海关稽查来函要求提供&quot;过去 36 个月全部特许权使用费的判定与分摊证据&quot;，财务翻了两周才把数据拼齐——问题不在做没做，而在<strong>没有能随时回答&quot;做得对不对&quot;的度量面</strong>。本文把合规从&quot;出事再补&quot;变成&quot;常态盯几个数&quot;，用一组可复算指标量化口径、时点、证据、金额与治理五类风险，并给出越界后的处置动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-风险度量的对象是-证据-口径-时点-三元组\">核心概念：风险度量的对象是&quot;证据—口径—时点&quot;三元组</h2><p>特许权使用费的合规风险不是单一维度。同一笔支付，可能被海关质疑&quot;这笔费与进口货物有关吗&quot;（口径风险）、&quot;你什么时候申报的&quot;（时点风险）、&quot;你凭什么这样分摊&quot;（证据风险）、&quot;分摊金额对不对&quot;（金额风险），以及&quot;谁在负责&quot;（治理风险）。五类风险各自需要不同指标，不能用一个&quot;合规率&quot;概括。</p>\n<p>度量指标要落到可复算的基座：<strong>每一次对境外支付的特许权使用费，在系统里都应有状态可追踪的记录</strong>，要么判定为不计入（留排除理由），要么分摊并申报（留申报回执）。指标就是统计这批记录的状态分布。判定依据见<a href=\"../customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-condition-of-sale\">特许权使用费与「销售条件」判定</a>，分摊口径见<a href=\"../customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-dutiability-apportionment\">特许权使用费应税性认定与分摊方法</a>，申报动作见<a href=\"../royalty-system-operations/crossborder-payment-withholding-tax\">跨境支付与代扣代缴</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[一笔对境外支付&lt;br/&gt;的特许权使用费] --&gt; J{已做应税性判定?}&#10;    J --&gt;|否| R1[口径风险&lt;br/&gt;unjudged]&#10;    J --&gt;|是| A{判定应计入?}&#10;    A --&gt;|否| R2[需留排除依据&lt;br/&gt;exclusion evidence]&#10;    A --&gt;|是| S[分摊并形成申报义务]&#10;    S --&gt; T{支付后 30 日内&lt;br/&gt;完成申报?}&#10;    T --&gt;|逾期| R3[时点风险&lt;br/&gt;late filing]&#10;    T --&gt;|按时| V{分摊额可复算&lt;br/&gt;且与台账一致?}&#10;    V --&gt;|不一致| R4[金额风险&lt;br/&gt;recompute delta]&#10;    V --&gt;|一致| OK[无异常]&#10;    R1 --&gt; M[进入指标看板]&#10;    R2 --&gt; M&#10;    R3 --&gt; M&#10;    R4 --&gt; M&#10;    OK --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n    P[一笔对境外支付&lt;br/&gt;的特许权使用费] --&gt; J{已做应税性判定?}\n    J --&gt;|否| R1[口径风险&lt;br/&gt;unjudged]\n    J --&gt;|是| A{判定应计入?}\n    A --&gt;|否| R2[需留排除依据&lt;br/&gt;exclusion evidence]\n    A --&gt;|是| S[分摊并形成申报义务]\n    S --&gt; T{支付后 30 日内&lt;br/&gt;完成申报?}\n    T --&gt;|逾期| R3[时点风险&lt;br/&gt;late filing]\n    T --&gt;|按时| V{分摊额可复算&lt;br/&gt;且与台账一致?}\n    V --&gt;|不一致| R4[金额风险&lt;br/&gt;recompute delta]\n    V --&gt;|一致| OK[无异常]\n    R1 --&gt; M[进入指标看板]\n    R2 --&gt; M\n    R3 --&gt; M\n    R4 --&gt; M\n    OK --&gt; M</pre><p>上图的四条分支对应四类可度量风险，第五类（治理风险）不在单笔流程里，而是衡量&quot;这套流程本身是否被持续执行&quot;。五类风险与指标、阈值、处置动作的对应关系如下表，构成本文的操作骨架。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类别</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>2026 参考阈值</th>\n<th>越界处置动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>口径风险</td>\n<td>未判定笔数占比 <code>unjudged_rate</code></td>\n<td>0%（任何一笔无判定即告警）</td>\n<td>24 小时内补判定，无依据者默认按应税处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时点风险</td>\n<td>后续支付按时申报率 <code>on_time_rate</code></td>\n<td>≥99%</td>\n<td>逐笔补报并测算滞纳金敞口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据风险</td>\n<td>结论可复算率 <code>recompute_rate</code></td>\n<td>≥95%</td>\n<td>对不可复算批次重建分摊底稿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额风险</td>\n<td>分摊复算差 <code>recompute_delta</code></td>\n<td>≤1%（单笔）</td>\n<td>差异&gt;1% 触发复核，&gt;5% 上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理风险</td>\n<td>治理成熟度分 <code>governance_score</code></td>\n<td>≥3.5 / 5.0</td>\n<td>落到整改项，指定负责人与期限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖率与及时率-两个最容易被忽略的基础指标\">覆盖率与及时率：两个最容易被忽略的基础指标</h2><p><strong>覆盖率（<code>coverage_rate</code>）</strong> 衡量&quot;应纳入管理的付汇笔数中，实际被系统收录并判定的比例&quot;。分母不是&quot;付了多少笔&quot;，而是&quot;付了多少笔<strong>可能与进口货物相关</strong>的对外支付&quot;——许可费、技术提成、品牌使用费、软件分发许可，以及被命名为&quot;服务费&quot;但实质是权利对价的付款。常见漏点是把打包的&quot;技术支持与品牌授权年费&quot;整笔记为服务费，既未判定也未摊分（依据见 213 号令体系对&quot;与进口货物有关&quot;的实质认定，<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>；WCO 判例见 <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/valuation/instruments-and-tools.aspx\">WCO Valuation Instruments and Tools</a>）。覆盖率低于 100% 意味着存在&quot;账外费用&quot;，这在稽查中是最难辩解的一类。</p>\n<p><strong>及时率（<code>on_time_rate</code>）</strong> 衡量后续支付特许权使用费的申报时点履约情况。中国对进口货物放行后支付的特许权使用费，要求在<strong>每次支付后 30 日内</strong>向海关申报纳税（海关总署公告 2019 年第 58 号，<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>）。这个 30 日窗口是硬时点，以<strong>支付日</strong>起算，而非合同结算日或会计入账日。分母是当期实际应税支付笔数，分子是其中在 30 日内完成申报的笔数。</p>\n<p>两者与税负的关系可用敞口表达。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 笔支付的应计入额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，关税税率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{d,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，进口环节增值税税率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{VAT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（现行标准 13%），则该笔漏报的税负敞口为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i = R_i \\times \\Big(\\tau_{d,i} + (1 + \\tau_{d,i}) \\times \\tau_{VAT}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若逾期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 天，另加滞纳金：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>0.0005</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i = E_i \\times 0.0005 \\times m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0005</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（滞纳金按应纳税额每日 0.5‰ 加收，依据《海关法》及<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>相关规定。）及时率因此不是&quot;流程美观度&quot;指标，它直接映射成可计量的资金敞口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i + L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。每月把 <code>逾期笔数 × 平均 R × 综合税率</code> 记入风险准备，是把时点风险财务化的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊复算差-把-回放证据-变成可计算的数\">分摊复算差：把&quot;回放证据&quot;变成可计算的数</h2><p>证据风险最直接的度量是<strong>能不能独立复算</strong>。做法是：审计方（或系统自身）拿台账原始数据——覆盖范围清单、各法域销售额、进口批次表、许可期间——重新跑一遍分摊算法，把算出的应计入额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{recompute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与申报时填写的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{filed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相减，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i = \\frac{R^{recompute}_i - R^{filed}_i}{R^{filed}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7779em;vertical-align:-1.1339em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.143em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1339em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>recompute_delta</code> 就是这个相对差的分布（P50/P95/最大值）。同一份原始数据重跑分摊，误差应只来自舍入；一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过 1%，几乎总说明<strong>合同事实与分摊基准之间出现了漂移</strong>——例如合同覆盖范围年中扩大，但分摊分母仍沿用旧清单，或分母里混入了无来源的市场。</p>\n<p>这里的底层要求与第 2 章一致：分摊依据必须能被海关复算（见 <a href=\"../customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-dutiability-apportionment\">特许权使用费应税性认定与分摊方法</a>）。区别在于第 2 章讲&quot;怎么算&quot;，本文讲&quot;怎么知道自己算错了&quot;。实现 <code>recompute_delta</code> 的 SQL 骨架直接落在台账上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH recomputed AS (&#10;  SELECT f.alloc_id, f.r_filed,&#10;         lr.total_royalty * v.import_value / NULLIF(v.scope_value,0) AS r_re&#10;  FROM royalty_allocation f&#10;  JOIN license_royalty lr ON lr.id = f.license_id&#10;  JOIN allocation_value v  ON v.alloc_id = f.alloc_id&#10;  WHERE f.status = &#39;filed&#39;)&#10;SELECT alloc_id, r_filed, r_re, (r_re-r_filed)/r_filed AS delta&#10;FROM recomputed&#10;WHERE ABS((r_re-r_filed)/r_filed) &gt; 0.01&#10;ORDER BY delta DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recomputed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alloc_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r_filed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         lr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_royalty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">import_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scope_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r_re</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> royalty_allocation f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> license_royalty lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">license_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allocation_value v  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alloc_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alloc_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'filed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alloc_id, r_filed, r_re, (r_re</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r_filed)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r_filed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recomputed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((r_re</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r_filed)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r_filed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>recompute_rate</code>（可复算率）= 能跑通上述复算且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i \\le 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span> 的批次 / 全部已申报批次。它比&quot;资料齐备率&quot;更强：资料齐备只说明文件在，可复算说明<strong>结论能被独立验证</strong>。实务经验是，可复算率低于 90% 的企业，其分摊口径在稽查中大概率被整体推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理成熟度-用-lease-五维给流程本身打分\">治理成熟度：用 LEASE 五维给流程本身打分</h2><p>前四类指标度量&quot;单笔处理&quot;，治理成熟度度量&quot;这套机制是否稳定运转&quot;。可借用五维打分框架 <strong>LEASE</strong>——法律依据（Legal basis）、证据留存（Evidence）、自动化（Automation）、监控（Supervision）、可复算（Estimability）——每维 1–5 分，取加权均值得到 <code>governance_score</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>1 分（初始）</th>\n<th>3 分（规范）</th>\n<th>5 分（优化）</th>\n<th>主要证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Legal basis</td>\n<td>无书面判定标准</td>\n<td>有成文规则并培训</td>\n<td>规则随法规变更版本化</td>\n<td>手册版本记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Evidence</td>\n<td>台账散落 Excel</td>\n<td>统一台账并留原始凭证</td>\n<td>举证包可一键导出</td>\n<td>导出审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Automation</td>\n<td>手工计算分摊</td>\n<td>系统自动分摊并出底稿</td>\n<td>复算与申报闭环校验</td>\n<td>自动化覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Supervision</td>\n<td>无例行检查</td>\n<td>月度指标看板</td>\n<td>阈值自动告警并派单</td>\n<td>告警闭环率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Estimability</td>\n<td>无法复算</td>\n<td>抽样可复算</td>\n<td>全量可复算（≥95%）</td>\n<td><code>recompute_delta</code> 分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条框架的核心不是打出漂亮分数，而是让&quot;治理&quot;本身进入可量化的讨论面：Legal basis 拿 5 分、Automation 只拿 2 分，说明规则清楚但执行靠人工，宕机风险仍在人身上；反过来 Automation 满分而 Estimability 低，说明系统跑得顺但从没被独立复算验证过——两类企业在稽查中的脆弱点完全不同。</p>\n<p>成熟度目标值应与企业规模匹配。中小企业做到 3 分（规范）即可覆盖大部分稽查关注点；跨国集团涉及转让定价与多法域（OECD 无形资产 DEMPE 分析、欧盟 UCC 第 71 条、美国 19 CFR 152.103(f)），Estimability 与 Evidence 两维应拉到 4–5 分，否则难以应对同期资料与海关估价两套口径的一致性要求（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/\">WCO/OECD 海关估价与转让定价指南</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警阈值-处置动作与闭环\">告警阈值、处置动作与闭环</h2><p>指标只有配上阈值和处置动作才构成风控。原则是：<strong>口径与时点类风险零容忍</strong>（确定性规则违反），<strong>证据与金额类风险给容忍带</strong>（受数据质量影响），<strong>治理风险按周期考核</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[指标看板&lt;br/&gt;每月运行] --&gt; C{哪类越界?}&#10;    C --&gt;|unjudged_rate &gt; 0| A1[当日补判定&lt;br/&gt;无依据默认应税]&#10;    C --&gt;|on_time_rate &lt; 99%| A2[逐笔补报&lt;br/&gt;测滞纳金敞口 E+L]&#10;    C --&gt;|recompute_rate &lt; 95%| A3[重建不可复算批次底稿]&#10;    C --&gt;|单笔 delta &gt; 5%| A4[升级评审&lt;br/&gt;回溯修订台账与同期资料]&#10;    C --&gt;|governance_score &lt; 3.5| A5[生成整改项&lt;br/&gt;指定负责人与期限]&#10;    A1 --&gt; CL[闭环记录]&#10;    A2 --&gt; CL&#10;    A3 --&gt; CL&#10;    A4 --&gt; CL&#10;    A5 --&gt; CL&#10;    CL --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    D[指标看板&lt;br/&gt;每月运行] --&gt; C{哪类越界?}\n    C --&gt;|unjudged_rate &gt; 0| A1[当日补判定&lt;br/&gt;无依据默认应税]\n    C --&gt;|on_time_rate &lt; 99%| A2[逐笔补报&lt;br/&gt;测滞纳金敞口 E+L]\n    C --&gt;|recompute_rate &lt; 95%| A3[重建不可复算批次底稿]\n    C --&gt;|单笔 delta &gt; 5%| A4[升级评审&lt;br/&gt;回溯修订台账与同期资料]\n    C --&gt;|governance_score &lt; 3.5| A5[生成整改项&lt;br/&gt;指定负责人与期限]\n    A1 --&gt; CL[闭环记录]\n    A2 --&gt; CL\n    A3 --&gt; CL\n    A4 --&gt; CL\n    A5 --&gt; CL\n    CL --&gt; D</pre><p>闭环的关键是每次告警都留下&quot;谁在何时做了什么&quot;的记录，且下月运行能验证该告警是否消失。同一指标连续三个月越界，说明处置无效，应升级为流程改造（如自动触发申报、分摊分母改为合同驱动动态计算），而非继续逐笔打补丁。指标看板本质上就是分摊台账底座上的监控层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>&quot;我们有台账，就等于有风控。&quot;</strong> 台账记录&quot;做了什么&quot;，指标记录&quot;做对没有&quot;。没有 <code>recompute_delta</code> 和 <code>on_time_rate</code> 的台账，只是事后能查到，不能事前预警。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;及时率是财务的 KPI。&quot;</strong> 30 日窗口以支付日起算，跨越财务、合规与业务三个环节；挂在单一部门会导致付款与申报之间的时点断点无人负责。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;分数高就代表合规。&quot;</strong> <code>governance_score</code> 高而 <code>recompute_delta</code> 大，说明制度齐备但执行失真——两个方向要交叉验证，互为对方的独立证据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风险分五类：口径（未判定）、时点（逾期申报）、证据（不可复算）、金额（分摊差）、治理（流程不稳），各有独立指标，不能压成一个&quot;合规率&quot;。</li>\n<li>基础指标 <code>coverage_rate</code>（应纳入付汇中被判定的占比）与 <code>on_time_rate</code>（支付后 30 日内申报率），后者直接映射为税款与滞纳金敞口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i + L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><code>recompute_delta</code> 由独立重跑分摊算法得到，超过 1% 即说明合同事实与分摊基准漂移。</li>\n<li>治理用 LEASE 五维打分，跨国集团需在证据与可复算两维达到 4–5 分。</li>\n<li>指标必须配阈值与处置动作并闭环；同一指标连续三个月越界应升级为流程改造，而非逐笔打补丁。</li>\n<li>跨境法域差异（欧盟 UCC 第 71 条、美国 19 CFR 152.103(f)）会影响阈值设定，不能假设一套口径适用于所有法域。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权利金风险控制与度量指标","id":"权利金风险控制与度量指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：风险度量的对象是\"证据—口径—时点\"三元组","id":"核心概念-风险度量的对象是-证据-口径-时点-三元组"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖率与及时率：两个最容易被忽略的基础指标","id":"覆盖率与及时率-两个最容易被忽略的基础指标"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊复算差：把\"回放证据\"变成可计算的数","id":"分摊复算差-把-回放证据-变成可计算的数"},{"level":2,"text":"治理成熟度：用 LEASE 五维给流程本身打分","id":"治理成熟度-用-lease-五维给流程本身打分"},{"level":2,"text":"告警阈值、处置动作与闭环","id":"告警阈值-处置动作与闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海关估价稽查与补税应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/compliance-audit-risk/customs-valuation-audit-defense"},"next":{"title":"估价争议解决与追溯调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/compliance-audit-risk/valuation-dispute-retroactive-adjustment"}}